OL,3,GNEWSAHow you can celebrate Diwali for
OL,4,Afree across the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe five-day festival symbolises the
OL,7,Ftriumph of light over darkness, good
OL,8,Fover evil, and knowledge over
OL,9,Fignorance.
OL,11,FHere are some of the free Diwali events
OL,12,Ftaking place across the West Midlands
OL,13,Fthis year.
